  {
    "@id": "https://www.allbodiesdance.ca/events-1/culture-days-adult-seniors-workshop",
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Culture Days - Adult & Seniors Workshop | All Bodies Dance"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Come join <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://culturedays.ca/en/events/f85702d2-b97f-4f23-85fb-6cac8848db63\">All Bodies Dance Project on September 23rd</a> who will be giving a dance workshop from 1 pm to 2 p.m. \nThis event is part of Culture Days</p>\nAccess\n<p>Free.</p>\n<p>Offered in English, Chinese, Mandarin, and Cantonese.</p>\n<p>Wheelchair accessible and has gender-neutral washrooms.</p>\nAbout\n<p>All Bodies Dance brings together adults, seniors of all abilities, genders, sizes, and backgrounds to explore movement as a means of expression. Participants experience the joy of dancing in a diverse community of movers where all our differences and disabilities are celebrated. This workshop will explore improvisation, drawing from contemporary dance in an open, safe and creative environment.  Absolutely no skill or experience required.</p>\n<p>Please wear appropriate, loose fitting, comfortable clothes for moving, and runners (non-rubber marking).</p>\nLinks\n<ul><li><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/all-bodies-dance-project-adult-and-seniors-workshop-tickets-689108932367?aff&#61;oddtdtcreator\">REGISTER HERE!</a></li></ul>\nOrganizer\nPigeon Den Art Collective\n<p>PIGEON DEN ART COLLECTIVE</p>\n<p>The Pigeon Den Collective is to invite collaboration between different artists to create works that invite social, and cultural change, and that support community-based art in all forms.</p>\n<p>\nFree workshops as part of Our Voices, Ourselves Community Hub to celebrate Culture Days in the Strathcona Community. \nThe Our Voices, Ourselves Community Hub Kickoff event will feature free performances by ABADA Capoeira, Fluffy &amp; Friends, and the All Bodies Dance Project. \nSeptember 23rd Arrive by 11:45 pm as Ceremonies start at 12 noon! \n\nID: A photo of Lance (he/him) and Rianne (she/they) smiling into the camera. Rianne has their tongue out and is making peace signs. See above for text.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>"
      }
    ],
