  {
    "@id": "https://www.allbodiesdance.ca/events-1/culture-days-all-bodies-dance",
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Culture Days - All Bodies Dance | All Bodies Dance"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Come join All Bodies Dance at North Vancouver Recreation and Culture\nThis event is part of <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://culturedays.ca/en/events/94a9212b-09f6-4967-917d-3fb548962eab\">Culture Days</a>\nAccess\n<p>Free.</p>\n<p>Offered in English.</p>\n<p>Wheelchair accessible and has gender-neutral washrooms.</p>\nAbout\n<p>All Bodies Dance Project brings together adults of all abilities, genders, sizes and backgrounds to explore movement as a means of expression in the form of workshops. Experience the joy of dancing in an open, safe and joyful environment where all our differences and disabilities are celebrated. Classes focus on improvisation, drawing from contemporary dance and theatre techniques. Absolutely no experience or skill is required! Anyone who requires one-to-one support must bring their own attendant.</p>\n<p>Class ID #241350</p>\nLinks\n<ul><li><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.nvrc.ca/\">NVRC website</a>nvrc.ca</li></ul>\nOrganizer\nNorth Vancouver Recreation and Culture\n<p>North Vancouver Recreation and Culture (NVRC) values and supports the arts.  As a community we acknowledge the power of creative activity to inspire minds, encourage expression, improve the quality of life and health outcomes. NVRC offers a wide array of learn-to registered arts programs in a variety of disciplines and artistic mediums including: performing arts, dance, music, visual arts and pottery. NVRC&#39;s highly qualified arts instructors inspire individuals of all ages and abilities to try something new and discover the artist within.</p>"
      }
    ],
